{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c000", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 0, "source_start": 0, "source_end": 14, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Authentication", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 14, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c001", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 1, "source_start": 0, "source_end": 366, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Authentication\n\nAll API requests must include a valid JWT token in the Authorization header. Tokens are obtained by POSTing to /api/v2/auth/token with valid credentials. Tokens expire after 3600 seconds (1 hour) by default. The maximum token lifetime is 86400 seconds (24 hours) for service accounts. Token refresh is supported via the /api/v2/auth/refresh endpoint.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 366, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0"], "paragraph_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c002", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 2, "source_start": 368, "source_end": 621, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": true, "text": "Authentication\n\nSupported Authentication Methods\nJWT Bearer Token: standard for web applications\nAPI Key: for server-to-server communication (X-API-Key header)\nOAuth 2.0: for third-party integrations\nmTLS: for high-security environments (mutual TLS client certificates)", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 269, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0#l0"], "list_item_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s0#l0#0", "api_docs_lambda#s0#l0#1", "api_docs_lambda#s0#l0#2", "api_docs_lambda#s0#l0#3"]}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c003", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 3, "source_start": 623, "source_end": 634, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Rate Limits", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 11, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c004", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 4, "source_start": 623, "source_end": 1015, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Rate Limits\n\nThe API enforces rate limiting on a per-token basis. Default limits are 100 requests per minute for standard accounts and 1000 requests per minute for premium accounts. Rate limit headers (X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining, X-RateLimit-Reset) are included in every response. When the limit is exceeded, a 429 Too Many Requests status is returned with a Retry-After header.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 392, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1"], "paragraph_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c005", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 5, "source_start": 1017, "source_end": 1271, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": true, "text": "Rate Limits\n\nTier | Rate Limit | Burst Limit | Monthly Quota\nFree | 20 req/min | 30 req/min | 10,000 requests\nStandard | 100 req/min | 150 req/min | 500,000 requests\nPremium | 1,000 req/min | 1,500 req/min | 5,000,000 requests\nEnterprise | Custom | Custom | Unlimited", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 267, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1#t0"], "row_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@-1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@3"], "cell_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@-1:0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@-1:1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@-1:2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@-1:3", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@0:0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@0:1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@0:2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@0:3", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@1:0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@1:1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@1:2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@1:3", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@2:0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@2:1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@2:2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@2:3", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@3:0", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@3:1", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@3:2", "api_docs_lambda#s1#t0@3:3"], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c006", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 6, "source_start": 1273, "source_end": 1282, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Endpoints", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 9, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c007", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 7, "source_start": 1273, "source_end": 1529, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Endpoints\n\nThe API exposes RESTful endpoints under the base URL https://api.example.com/v2. All responses are JSON-encoded. Pagination is implemented using cursor-based navigation with a default page size of 50 items and a maximum of 200 items per request.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 256, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2"], "paragraph_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
{"chunk_id": "api_docs_lambda::c008", "document_id": "api_docs_lambda", "sequence": 8, "source_start": 1531, "source_end": 1912, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": true, "text": "Endpoints\n\nMethod | Endpoint | Description | Auth Required\nPOST | /auth/token | Obtain access token | No\nGET | /documents | List all documents | Yes\nPOST | /documents | Upload a new document | Yes\nGET | /documents/{id} | Get document details | Yes\nDELETE | /documents/{id} | Delete a document | Yes\nPOST | /qa/ask | Ask a question | Yes\nGET | /embeddings/status | Check embedding status | Yes", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 392, "source_document_hash": "4f209f437655d07fbe0d86d4754e966e142473dbdea726cd6bf9faa9dff64586", "structure": {"section_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2"], "paragraph_ids": [], "table_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2#t0"], "row_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@-1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@4", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@5", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@6"], "cell_ids": ["api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@-1:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@-1:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@-1:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@-1:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@0:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@0:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@0:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@0:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@1:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@1:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@1:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@1:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@2:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@2:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@2:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@2:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@3:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@3:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@3:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@3:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@4:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@4:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@4:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@4:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@5:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@5:1", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@5:2", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@5:3", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@6:0", "api_docs_lambda#s2#t0@